## Game backgrounds and artwork (Assets/Backgrounds/Games/): 62 files, 416 MB.
##
## Not in the repository: they ship as a separate package attached to a release, and
## the installer unpacks them into %ProgramData%\Playfront\Assets. Releases have no
## size or bandwidth limit; the repository is worth keeping small, and 416 MB would
## be paid for only by whoever clones the code.
##
## Consequence when building from a clean checkout (CI, for example): these files will
## not be there. build/Pack-Playfront.ps1 detects that and packages the program anyway,
## just without the assets zip.
##
## The app starts and works WITHOUT them (see src/Playfront.App/AssetPaths.cs).
src/Playfront.App/Assets/Backgrounds/Games/
